    {
      "id": "d411ba830b4952f3b97303adf06c741959205dc0",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 681372418,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I did this in a pristine build directory right after running CMake.\n\n`egrep GNUTLS config.h`\n```\n/* #undef HAVE_LIBGNUTLS */\n#define HAVE_GNUTLS_PKCS11 1\n```\n\n`egrep GNUTLS CMakeCache.txt`\n```\nENABLE_GNUTLS:BOOL=OFF\nGNUTLS_INCLUDE_DIR:PATH=/usr/include\nGNUTLS_LIBRARY:FILEPATH=/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libgnutls.so\npkgcfg_lib_GNUTLS_gnutls:FILEPATH=/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libgnutls.so\n//MODIFIED property for variable: ENABLE_GNUTLS\nENABLE_GNUTLS-MODIFIED:INTERNAL=ON\n//Details about finding GNUTLS\nFIND_PACKAGE_MESSAGE_DETAILS_GNUTLS:INTERNAL=[/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libgnutls.so][/usr/include][v3.7.1(3.3.0)]\nGNUTLS_CFLAGS:INTERNAL=-I/usr/include/p11-kit-1\nGNUTLS_CFLAGS_I:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_CFLAGS_OTHER:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_FOUND:INTERNAL=1\nGNUTLS_INCLUDEDIR:INTERNAL=/usr/include\nGNUTLS_INCLUDE_DIRS:INTERNAL=/usr/include/p11-kit-1\nGNUTLS_LDFLAGS:INTERNAL=-lgnutls\nGNUTLS_LDFLAGS_OTHER:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_LIBDIR:INTERNAL=/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu\nGNUTLS_LIBRARIES:INTERNAL=gnutls\nGNUTLS_LIBRARY_DIRS:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_LIBS:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_LIBS_L:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_LIBS_OTHER:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_LIBS_PATHS:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_MODULE_NAME:INTERNAL=gnutls\nGNUTLS_PREFIX:INTERNAL=/usr\nGNUTLS_STATIC_CFLAGS:INTERNAL=-I/usr/include/p11-kit-1\nGNUTLS_STATIC_CFLAGS_I:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_STATIC_CFLAGS_OTHER:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_STATIC_INCLUDE_DIRS:INTERNAL=/usr/include/p11-kit-1\nGNUTLS_STATIC_LDFLAGS:INTERNAL=-lgnutls;-pthread;-lgmp;-lunistring;-latomic;-lhogweed;-lgmp;-lnettle;-ltasn1;-lidn2;-lunistring;-lp11-kit\nGNUTLS_STATIC_LDFLAGS_OTHER:INTERNAL=-pthread\nGNUTLS_STATIC_LIBDIR:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_STATIC_LIBRARIES:INTERNAL=gnutls;gmp;unistring;atomic;hogweed;gmp;nettle;tasn1;idn2;unistring;p11-kit\nGNUTLS_STATIC_LIBRARY_DIRS:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_STATIC_LIBS:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_STATIC_LIBS_L:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_STATIC_LIBS_OTHER:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_STATIC_LIBS_PATHS:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_VERSION:INTERNAL=3.7.1\nGNUTLS_gnutls_INCLUDEDIR:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_gnutls_LIBDIR:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_gnutls_PREFIX:INTERNAL=\nGNUTLS_gnutls_VERSION:INTERNAL=\nHAVE_GNUTLS_PKCS11:INTERNAL=1\n__pkg_config_checked_GNUTLS:INTERNAL=1\n//ADVANCED property for variable: pkgcfg_lib_GNUTLS_gnutls\npkgcfg_lib_GNUTLS_gnutls-ADVANCED:INTERNAL=1\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 1898071,
            "username": "utoni",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Toni",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9607299dd8cde6fbc1e0b387e06a6d71a81d14e3e6fc5e4210c72f8318f9581d?s=80&d=identicon",
